  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Building Bridges and Empowering Voices to Anticipate and Prevent Conflict: a process of strategic reflection and data collection that will be included in a concept paper</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Through data collection and scenarios&#x2019; construction, the foundation will be laid to generate a reflection on the different possible futures to protect development and peace in politically constrained environments. Work will be done with social, economic, and political actors, always from an inclusive participation approach, in the co-creation of scenarios that are possible and plausible for anticipate and prevent crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
